@currentETag = "1"

### Download the current device configuration
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/firmware/devices/{{deviceId}}/config
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Return 304 when the cached configuration is current
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/firmware/devices/{{deviceId}}/config
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}
If-None-Match: {{currentETag}}
Accept: application/json

### Reject a request without a device token
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/firmware/devices/{{deviceId}}/config
Accept: application/json

### Reject a token for a different device
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/firmware/devices/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/config
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}
Accept: application/json
